is doesn't work on Windows. Correcting this manually to replace the forward slashes with backslashes makes it work. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Project -> Tools -> Configure Meta XR Simulator \n2. Select the path, done.\n3. Meta XR Simulator doesn't appear in the dropdown.\n\nSteps to fix:\n1. Editor -> Editor Settings -> OpenXR -> Runtime Paths\n2. Modify the Meta XR Simulator path by replacing forward slashes with backslashes.\n3. Meta XR Simulator appears in the dropdown and works as expected.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nA blank project should be fine. ","closed_by":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108272/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}